			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 22, DX 12, IQ 11, HT 14, HP 22, WILL 14, PER 11, FP 14, SPEED 6.5, MOVE 5, DODGE 10, DR 5. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
