			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 62 (offense 32, protection 30), threat tier major, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "AD4FjVlG9-kfUPAAq",
			"text": "Fear Aura: The cornugon can take a Ready maneuver to project an aura of fear. Everyone within 10 yards of the cornugon must roll an immediate Fright Check (p. B360). If a victim succeeds at his Fright Check, he will be unaffected by this cornugon’s Fear Aura for one hour."
		},
